3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,120
I'm not sure I'll fall asleep

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,320
Could you two please take a look?

5
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,720
Just absorb it directly on the main window. It's quite heavy.

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,920
It's very hard for us to drag you along

7
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:41,560
Ji Chuancheng
